# a build: the skills for Pi, and the agent
$ pipkg build --overlay-root <WORLD>/overlay --registry <WORLD>/overlay/skills.registry.yaml --dest-dir <WORLD>/out/labdrian-pi
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
pipkg build: labdrian-pi package written to <WORLD>/out/labdrian-pi
--- stderr ---

--- tree of out ---
labdrian-pi/
labdrian-pi/agents/
labdrian-pi/agents/GADU.md
labdrian-pi/extensions/
labdrian-pi/extensions/labdrian-gate.ts
labdrian-pi/mcp.json
labdrian-pi/package.json
labdrian-pi/skills/
labdrian-pi/skills/_shared/
labdrian-pi/skills/_shared/anti-generic-design.md
labdrian-pi/skills/_shared/minimalism-contract.md
labdrian-pi/skills/alpha/
labdrian-pi/skills/alpha/SKILL.md
labdrian-pi/skills/alpha/references/
labdrian-pi/skills/alpha/references/notes.md
labdrian-pi/skills/beta/
labdrian-pi/skills/beta/SKILL.md

--- out/labdrian-pi/package.json ---
{
  "name": "labdrian-pi",
  "version": "0.0.0-dev",
  "pi": {
    "skills": [
      "./skills"
    ],
    "agents": [
      "./agents"
    ],
    "extensions": [
      "./extensions"
    ],
    "mcp": "./mcp.json"
  }
}

# a build over a build replaces it
$ pipkg build --overlay-root <WORLD>/overlay --registry <WORLD>/overlay/skills.registry.yaml --dest-dir <WORLD>/out/labdrian-pi
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
pipkg build: labdrian-pi package written to <WORLD>/out/labdrian-pi
--- stderr ---

